  "body": "A rare offering in prestigious St Heliers, this exceptional brand-new freehold residence delivers refined luxury on an impressive scale — just a short stroll from St Heliers Beach and Village.\r\n\r\nDesigned for refined modern living, the home features five generous bedrooms, beautifully appointed bathrooms and multiple living spaces, offering an exceptional sense of space, comfort and versatility.\r\n\r\nAt its heart, a sophisticated designer kitchen showcases premium Miele appliances, generous workspace and a separate scullery, seamlessly connecting with the open-plan dining and living areas before flowing outdoors for effortless entertaining. A second lounge provides an elegant retreat and valuable separation.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the generous master suite with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite is complemented by four beautifully proportioned bedrooms, creating a private and peaceful family sanctuary.\r\n\r\nAn internal-access double garage, excellent storage, landscaped outdoor spaces and a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee complete this impressive home.\r\n\r\nYet perhaps the greatest luxury is the location.\r\n\r\nSt Heliers Beach, the waterfront, cafés, restaurants and village amenities are all within easy walking distance, placing one of Auckland’s most desirable coastal lifestyles right at your doorstep. Families will also appreciate the sought-after zoning for St Heliers School and Glendowie College.\r\n\r\nBrand-new homes of this scale and calibre are exceptionally rare in established St Heliers. Combining generous proportions, premium finishes and an enviable coastal lifestyle, this outstanding residence presents a remarkable opportunity to secure a sophisticated new home in one of Auckland’s most tightly held neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nExperience this exceptional St Heliers residence",
